1. OPNsense (derived material)

The generated API descriptions (IR, OpenAPI documents, coverage reports and
diffs) are derived from the MVC models, field types and API controllers
shipped in the OPNsense release packages (core and os-* plugins), and contain
material from them (names, structure, defaults, option values and labels).
The test fixtures in internal/*/testdata are shortened and modified copies of
such files.

